---
---

<section class="relative">
  <div class="relative h-[70vh] sm:h-[80vh] min-h-[500px]">
    <img
      src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554118811-1e0d58224f24?w=1600&q=80"
      alt="The pistachio-green interior of 118 Grinder with plants and rattan chairs"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-deep-forest/40" />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center px-5">
      <blockquote class="max-w-3xl text-center">
        <p class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-cream italic leading-relaxed">
          "Run by three young coffee lovers, in a corner of Wangsa Maju that feels like home."
        </p>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-cream py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 sm:px-8 text-center space-y-6">
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-sage-grey leading-relaxed">
        The bar is pistachio green. The chairs are rattan. The plants don't fake. We've been here a while now, and it still feels like the first week.
      </p>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-sage-grey leading-relaxed">
        Three young owners, one quiet corner, and coffee pulled with the kind of care that doesn't need to shout.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
